│ testing: the effect of a mailed patient flyer prior to an annual exam", "abstract": "INTRODUCTION AND AIMS           │
│ Professional societies recommend that the decision to screen for prostate cancer involves a shared discussion        │
│ between patient and provider. Many men are tested without this discussion. Prostate cancer screening decision aids   │
